<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Code knowledge graph for GitHub repos – GraphRAG chatbot design</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#f5f7fb; --panel:#fff; --ink:#1d2433; --muted:#5b6578; --line:#e2e7f0;
    --nav:#14213d; --accent:#2f6fde; --accent-soft:#e8f0fe; --sel:#e11d48;
    --code-bg:#0f172a; --code-ink:#e2e8f0; --ok:#15803d; --warn:#b45309; --bad:#b91c1c;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.55 "Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
  a{color:var(--accent)}
  code{font-family:Consolas,"Cascadia Code","Fira Code",monospace;font-size:.9em;background:#eef1f7;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px}
  b{font-weight:600}

  header.top{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;background:var(--nav);color:#fff;padding:11px 22px 0}
  header.top .row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  header.top h1{font-size:19px;margin:0;font-weight:600}
  header.top .sub{color:#9fb0d0;font-size:13px}
  nav.tabs{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-top:7px;overflow-x:auto}
  nav.tabs button{background:none;border:0;color:#c3cee6;padding:8px 14px;font:inherit;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap}
  nav.tabs button:hover{color:#fff}
  nav.tabs button.active{color:#fff;border-bottom-color:#6ea8ff}
  main{padding:12px 18px 48px}
  section.tab{display:none}
  section.tab.active{display:block}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto}

  /* ---------- graph explorer ---------- */
  .strip{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;align-items:center;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:7px 12px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:13.5px}
  .strip .note{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px}
  .pill{display:inline-block;border-radius:999px;padding:1px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
  .pill.ok{background:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;border:1px solid #86efac}
  .explorer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) clamp(340px,26vw,440px);gap:12px;height:calc(100vh - 170px);min-height:600px}
  .gcard{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}
  .toolbar{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}
  .toolbar .r{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;align-items:center}
  .tl{color:var(--muted);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em}
  .seg{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
  .seg .btns{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid #cdd5e3;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
  .seg button{border:0;background:#fff;padding:3px 11px;font:inherit;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}
  .seg button+button{border-left:1px solid #cdd5e3}
  .seg button.on{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
  .chk{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;cursor:pointer}
  .qsel{display:inline-flex;gap:7px;align-items:center}
  .qsel select{font:inherit;font-size:13px;padding:3px 6px;border:1px solid #cdd5e3;border-radius:8px;max-width:360px;background:#fff}
  .lchips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}
  .lchip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid #cdd5e3;background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px 2px 6px;font:inherit;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}
  .lchip .sw{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid}
  .lchip .n{color:var(--muted);font-size:11.5px}
  .lchip[aria-pressed="false"]{opacity:.45}
  .lchip[aria-pressed="false"] .lbl{text-decoration:line-through}
  .gwrap{position:relative;flex:1;min-height:0;background:#fbfcfe}
  svg#kg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block;cursor:grab;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}
  svg#kg.panning{cursor:grabbing}
  .zoom{position:absolute;right:10px;bottom:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
  .zoom button{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #cdd5e3;background:#fff;font-size:17px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;color:var(--ink)}
  .zoom button:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
  .hint{position:absolute;left:10px;bottom:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;pointer-events:none}
  aside.panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow-y:auto;padding:14px 16px 18px;min-height:0}
  @media (max-width:1100px){.explorer{grid-template-columns:1fr;height:auto}.gwrap{height:640px;flex:none}}

  /* svg */
  .region rect{stroke-dasharray:6 5}
  .region text{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .node{cursor:pointer}
  .node .body{stroke-width:2.5}
  .node:hover .body,.node:focus .body{stroke-width:4}
  .node:focus{outline:none}
  .node text.nl{font-weight:600;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:central;pointer-events:none}
  .node .badge circle{fill:#fff;stroke-width:1.5}
  .node .badge text{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:central;pointer-events:none}
  .edge .line{fill:none;stroke:#98a5bb;stroke-width:1.7}
  .edge .hit{fill:none;stroke:transparent;stroke-width:16;cursor:pointer}
  .elabel{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;fill:#4b5568;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fbfcfe;stroke-width:5px;stroke-linejoin:round;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .elabel:hover{fill:var(--accent)}
  .dim{opacity:.12}
  .edge.hl .line{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2.8}
  .elabel.hl{fill:#1d4ed8}
  .edge.sel .line{stroke:var(--sel);stroke-width:3.2}
  .elabel.sel{fill:var(--sel)}
  .node.sel .body{stroke:#0f172a;stroke-width:4.5}
  .qmode .edge.hl .line{stroke-dasharray:9 6;animation:flow 1.1s linear infinite}
  @keyframes flow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-30}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.qmode .edge.hl .line{animation:none}}

  /* panel */
  .p-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:4px}
  .tag{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid #cdd5e3;border-radius:999px;padding:1px 9px;background:#f3f5fa;color:#334155}
  .p-title{font-size:22px;margin:2px 0 6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;word-break:break-word;line-height:1.25}
  .p-title .dot{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 14px}
  .p-what{margin:0 0 8px;color:#334155}
  .keybox{background:#f6f8fc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:13px;margin:8px 0}
  .keybox .k{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)}
  .keybox .ex{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:2px;word-break:break-all}
  aside.panel h4{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);margin:16px 0 6px;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}
  .count{background:#e8edf6;color:#334155;border-radius:999px;padding:0 7px;font-size:11px}
  .props{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
  .prop{padding:6px 10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .prop:first-child{border-top:0}
  .prop .ph{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:baseline}
  .prop .pn{background:none;padding:0;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;font-size:13px}
  .prop .pt{font:12px Consolas,monospace;color:#7c3aed;white-space:nowrap}
  .prop .pe{font:12px/1.45 Consolas,monospace;color:#0f766e;word-break:break-all;margin-top:1px}
  .prop .pnote{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:1px}
  .rels{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
  .rel{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:7px;padding:4px 8px;font:inherit;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}
  .rel:hover{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft)}
  .rel .dir{width:16px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;text-align:center}
  .rel code{background:none;padding:0;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b}
  .rel .other{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;border-radius:999px;padding:0 8px;border:1px solid;white-space:nowrap}
  .pattern{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:6px 0 10px;font:13px Consolas,monospace;color:#334155}
  .nchip{font:600 12.5px "Segoe UI",sans-serif;border:1.5px solid;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px;cursor:pointer;background:#fff}
  .kv{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
  .kv b{color:var(--ink)}
  .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin:10px 0}
  .stats div{background:#f6f8fc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  .stats b{display:block;font-size:22px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2}
  .legend-list{padding-left:18px;margin:6px 0}
  .legend-list li{margin:4px 0}
  .rules{padding-left:20px;margin:6px 0;font-size:13.5px}
  .rules li{margin:5px 0}
  ul.qs{padding-left:18px;margin:4px 0;font-size:13.5px}
  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin:6px 0}
  details.ex{margin-top:6px}
  details.ex summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}

  /* code */
  .codeblock{margin:8px 0 12px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #1e293b;background:var(--code-bg)}
  .codehead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#1e293b;color:#94a3b8;font:12px Consolas,monospace;padding:5px 10px;gap:8px}
  .codehead .lang{background:#334155;color:#e2e8f0;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px;margin-right:8px}
  .copy{background:#334155;color:#e2e8f0;border:0;border-radius:5px;padding:2px 9px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}
  .copy:hover{background:#475569}
  pre{margin:0;padding:11px 13px;overflow-x:auto;color:var(--code-ink);font:12.5px/1.55 Consolas,"Cascadia Code",monospace;tab-size:4}
  pre code{background:none;padding:0;font-size:inherit;color:inherit}
  aside.panel pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:12px}
  .t-k{color:#7dd3fc;font-weight:600}.t-s{color:#a7f3d0}.t-c{color:#8190aa;font-style:italic}.t-n{color:#fca5a5}
  .t-l{color:#fcd34d}.t-p{color:#f0abfc}.t-f{color:#c4b5fd}.t-d{color:#f9a8d4}

  /* content tabs */
  h2.sec{font-size:28px;margin:10px 0 4px;line-height:1.25}
  p.lead{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 14px}
  h3{font-size:20px;margin:30px 0 10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px}
  .card h4{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px}
  .card p{margin:0}
  .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
  .grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
  @media (max-width:900px){.grid2,.grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .num{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:8px}
  .hero{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:6px solid var(--ok);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 20px;margin:6px 0 16px}
  .hero h2{font-size:26px;margin:6px 0 6px;line-height:1.3}
  .callout{border-left:4px solid var(--accent);background:#fff;padding:11px 15px;margin:16px 0;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .callout strong{display:block;margin-bottom:3px}
  .callout.key{border-left-color:#7c3aed;background:#faf7ff}
  .callout.warn{border-left-color:var(--warn);background:#fffbf2}
  .callout.why{border-left-color:var(--ok);background:#f4fbf6}
  .callout.small{font-size:13.5px;padding:8px 12px;margin:10px 0}
  .compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px 1fr 1fr;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}
  .compare > div{padding:9px 13px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
  .compare .ch{background:#f0f3f9;font-weight:700;border-top:0}
  .compare .ch.good{background:#e8f5ec;color:#14532d}
  .compare .rh{font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
  .compare .g{background:#f7fcf8}
  @media (max-width:700px){.compare{grid-template-columns:1fr}.compare .ch:first-child{display:none}}
  .fit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
  @media (max-width:900px){.fit{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .fitcol{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:5px solid;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px}
  .fitcol h4{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:16px}
  .fitcol h4 span{font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-left:4px}
  .fitcol ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14px}
  .fitcol li{margin:4px 0}
  .fitcol.strong{border-top-color:var(--ok)} .fitcol.good{border-top-color:var(--accent)} .fitcol.weak{border-top-color:var(--warn)}
  .flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch;gap:0;margin:10px 0}
  .stage{flex:1 1 130px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:4px solid var(--accent);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13px;min-width:130px}
  .stage b{display:block;font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:3px}
  .stage .k{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}
  .arrow{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:20px}
  .lane{margin-top:8px;background:#fff7f7;border:1px dashed #fca5a5;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:13.5px}
  table.matrix{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;background:#fff;font-size:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
  table.matrix th,table.matrix td{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 11px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
  table.matrix th{background:#f0f3f9;font-size:13px}
  ol.steps{list-style:none;counter-reset:s;padding-left:0;margin:0}
  ol.steps > li{counter-increment:s;position:relative;padding-left:44px;margin:0 0 20px}
  ol.steps > li::before{content:counter(s);position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  ol.steps > li > b:first-child{font-size:16.5px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
  ol.steps p{margin:4px 0}
  .clock{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px}
  .clock h4{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
  .clock ol{margin:4px 0 0;padding-left:20px;font-size:14px}
  .clock li{margin:4px 0}
  .lim{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 15px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
  .lim h4{margin:0;font-size:15.5px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start}
  .lim .why{font-size:13.5px;color:#334155}
  .lim .fix{font-size:13.5px;background:#f4fbf6;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 9px}
  .lim .fix b{color:var(--ok)}
  .imp{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:1px 8px;white-space:nowrap}
  .imp.high{background:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b} .imp.med{background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e} .imp.low{background:#e0f2fe;color:#075985}
  .tline{position:relative;margin:10px 0 0 10px;padding-left:26px;border-left:3px solid #cbd5e1}
  .tphase{position:relative;margin:0 0 18px}
  .tphase::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-36px;top:4px;width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:4px solid var(--accent)}
  .tphase h4{margin:0 0 2px;font-size:17px}
  .tphase .when{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
  .tphase ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14px}
  .tphase .exit{font-size:13.5px;margin-top:6px;background:#f6f8fc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 10px}
  .small{font-size:13px}
  .muted{color:var(--muted)}
  table.tools{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;background:#fff;font-size:14px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  table.tools th,table.tools td{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 11px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
  table.tools th{background:#f0f3f9;font-size:13px}

  /* live data from the codekg database */
  .node.design .body{stroke-dasharray:5 4;fill-opacity:.45}
  .node text.ncount{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:central;pointer-events:none;opacity:.8}
  .livebox{background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;margin:10px 0;font-size:13px}
  .livebox.none{background:#f8fafc;border:1px dashed #cbd5e1}
  .livebox .lh{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:4px}
  .dot-live{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #dcfce7;flex:0 0 9px}
  .keys{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin:4px 0 6px}
  .keys code{font-size:11.5px}
  table.res{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px;margin:6px 0;background:#fff}
  table.res th,table.res td{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:4px 6px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word}
  table.res th{background:#f6f8fc}
  .kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:8px 0 6px}
  .kpi{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px}
  .kpi b{display:block;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2}
  .kpi span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
  .bars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
  .bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,260px) 1fr 44px;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:13px}
  .bar .track{background:#eef2f7;border-radius:6px;height:14px;overflow:hidden}
  .bar .fill{height:100%;background:var(--accent);border-radius:6px}
  .bar .v{text-align:right;color:var(--muted)}
  .chip{display:inline-block;border-radius:999px;padding:0 8px;font-size:11.5px;margin:1px 3px 1px 0;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;background:#fff;white-space:nowrap}
  .chip.success{border-color:#86efac;background:#f0fdf4}
  .chip.failure{border-color:#fca5a5;background:#fef2f2}
  table.org{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;background:#fff;font-size:13.5px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  table.org th,table.org td{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 9px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
  table.org th{background:#f0f3f9;font-size:12.5px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <div class="row">
    <h1>Code knowledge graph for the Cepheid-Data-Platform repos</h1>
    <span class="sub">GraphRAG chatbot design · Neo4j + embeddings · CI/CD and deployment status included</span>
  </div>
  <nav class="tabs" aria-label="Sections">
    <button data-tab="graph" class="active">1 · Knowledge graph</button>
    <button data-tab="org">2 · Your org (live)</button>
    <button data-tab="verdict">3 · Will it work?</button>
    <button data-tab="build">4 · Build &amp; ingest</button>
    <button data-tab="query">5 · How the chatbot answers</button>
    <button data-tab="limits">6 · Limitations</button>
    <button data-tab="roadmap">7 · Roadmap</button>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<noscript><p>This page needs JavaScript for the interactive graph.</p></noscript>

<!-- =========================== 1. GRAPH =========================== -->
<section class="tab active" id="tab-graph">
  <div class="strip">
    <span class="pill ok">Verdict: feasible</span>
    <span>Code already is a graph. <b>Parse it</b> rather than LLM-extracting it, store it in Neo4j with embeddings on functions, and let the chatbot combine vector search with graph traversal. <a href="#" data-goto="verdict">Why?</a></span>
    <span class="note" id="liveNote">Names like <code>dp-ingestion</code> or <code>gold.fact_orders</code> in the design panels are illustrative.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="explorer">
    <div class="gcard">
