    <div class="kpi"><b>${cnt('Deployment')}</b><span>deployments across ${cnt('Environment')} environments</span></div>
  </div>

  <h3>Apps and their components</h3>
  <p class="small muted">From the naming convention <code>cdp-genai-&lt;area&gt;-&lt;app&gt;-&lt;fe|be|st|mw|mcp-be&gt;</code>. Green / red = newest CI run on the default branch. ${single.length} more apps are a single repo.</p>
  <table class="org"><tr><th>Area</th><th>App</th><th>Components</th></tr>
